{"words": [{"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبُ", "translation": "(is) the book"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "no"}, {"text": "رَيْبَ ۛ", "translation": "doubt"}, {"text": "فِيهِ ۛ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "هُدًۭى", "translation": "a Guidance"}, {"text": "لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ", "translation": "for the God-conscious"}], "sahih": "This is the Book about which there is no doubt, a guidance for those conscious of Allāh1 -"}